        "Description": "The trail from Colombia has given us the key to defeat this Syndicate and stop their disturbing project. We have identified Naomi Oliveira, the new CEO of Torvik Research, as the organisation&apos;s benefactor. Alerted by our string of suspicious killings, she has fled to Haven, seeking a new identity at the Maldivian resort. Concerningly, she has also brought the finalised serum, watched over by her only lookout. It must be recovered. We are also aware of her sportive assassin - be cautious.",
